  "subject": "chore: bump version to v1.0.1974",
  "body": "Signed-off-by: Zach Aller <zach_aller@intuit.com>\n",
  "references": [
    {
      "commit": {
        "author": "\"svc-ci\" <code@example.com>",
        "date": "2026-07-27T07:26:28-05:00",
        "subject": "feat(ui): history view cell improvements and detail-drawer deep-linking (#1793)",
        "body": "* feat(ui): distinguish aged-out history cells from no-changes\n\nAdd an 'unknown-history' cell kind to the HistoryView matrix. When a\ncommit predates an environment's capped (5-entry) history, its record\nmay have been dropped, so we can no longer claim it never reached that\nenvironment. These cells now render distinctly with a hatched \"History\nunavailable\" treatment instead of the definitive \"No changes\".\n\nSigned-off-by: Jonathan Winters <wintersjonathan0@gmail.com>\n\n* feat(ui): deep-link to history view detail drawer\n\nAdd URL-driven cell selection to the HistoryView detail drawer so a\nspecific commit/environment cell can be linked and reopened.\n\nHistoryView gains an `initialSelection` prop and `onSelectionChange`\ncallback, keeping selection state internal while letting each host sync\nit to its own URL scheme. The dashboard uses `?commit=<sha>&env=<branch>`\nvia react-router; the Argo CD extension uses `?psCommit`/`?psEnv` and\nopens directly on the history tab when a selection is present. A stale\nlink whose cell no longer resolves clears the drawer and strips the\nparams.\n\nSigned-off-by: Jonathan Winters <wintersjonathan0@gmail.com>\n\n* chore(ui): bump immutable to 5.1.9 to fix npm audit failure\n\nThe dashboard's transitive immutable (via sass) triggered high-severity\nadvisories GHSA-v56q-mh7h-f735 and GHSA-xvcm-6775-5m9r, failing the\n`npm audit --omit=dev` gate in CI. Bump to the patched 5.1.9 (within\nsass's ^5.1.5 range; package.json unchanged).\n\nSigned-off-by: Jonathan Winters <wintersjonathan0@gmail.com>\n\n* fix(ui): reject deep links to non-selectable history cells\n\nThe selection validation effect accepted a cell from ?commit/?env even\nwhen its resolved kind was no-changes or unknown-history, opening the\ndrawer on a state the matrix and drawer navigation treat as\nnon-selectable. Validate the resolved cell with isEmptyCellKind.\n\nSigned-off-by: Jonathan Winters <wintersjonathan0@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Jonathan Winters <wintersjonathan0@gmail.com>",
        "sha": "44fbf23a6cae65296810b3ae17bbad1085c67204",
        "repoUrl": "https://github.com/argoproj-labs/gitops-promoter"
      }
    }
  ]
}
